---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Essential Chinese Phrases for Travelers";
const description = "Learn these basic Chinese phrases before your trip — pronunciation, when to use them, and tips for being understood.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Life
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🗣️ 中国生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Essential Chinese Phrases for Travelers
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">十几个短语会改变人们对待你的方式。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读4分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        You don't need to speak Chinese to travel in China. But learning a dozen phrases will make your trip immensely better — locals genuinely appreciate the effort, and you'll find yourself getting better service, warmer smiles, and even better prices at markets.
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#greetings" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">👋 问候和礼貌</a></li>
        <li><a href="#eating" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍽️ 用餐与点餐</a></li>
        <li><a href="#shopping" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛍️ 购物与价格</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 出行</a></li>
        <li><a href="#emergencies" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 紧急情况</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pronunciation" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎵 发音技巧</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="greetings" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">👋</span> Greetings & Politeness
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">救命！</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">仅适用于真正的紧急情况</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">显示中文地名</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">你好</td><td class="px-6 py-4">你好</td><td class="px-6 py-4">随时随地与任何人一起使用</td><td class="px-6 py-4">非常感谢。</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">谢谢</td><td class="px-6 py-4">谢谢</td><td class="px-6 py-4">经常说——人们会注意到</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起/打扰一下</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起</td><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">It's okay</td><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Goodbye</td><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td><td class="px-6 py-4">提示：</td><td class="px-6 py-4">在餐馆、商店、出租车上，每次交易后都要说“谢谢”。它在日常互动中发挥了重要作用。</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>第五步：旅行信息填写</strong> Say "Thank you" after every transaction — at restaurants, shops, taxis. It goes a long way in daily interactions.</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="eating" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍽️</span> Eating & Ordering
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">救命！</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">仅适用于真正的紧急情况</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">显示中文地名</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">毛丹</td><td class="px-6 py-4">买单</td><td class="px-6 py-4">美味的</td><td class="px-6 py-4">好吃！</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">嗨，嗨！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">好吃！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不要加辣</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不加辣</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">布贾拉</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不加辣</td><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">不要喝自来水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">购物与价格</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Don't drink tap water</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="shopping" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛍️</span> Shopping & Prices
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">救命！</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">仅适用于真正的紧急情况</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">显示中文地名</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">普遍价格问题</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多少钱？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">太贵了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">通用价格问题</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">仅在市场</td><td class="px-6 py-4">太贵了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">便宜一点？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Only at markets</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">在市场而非商店使用</td><td class="px-6 py-4">便宜一点？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我要这个</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Use at markets, not stores</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">当你决定了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我要这个</td><td class="px-6 py-4">出行</td><td class="px-6 py-4">When you've decided</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚇</span> Getting Around
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">救命！</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">仅适用于真正的紧急情况</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">显示中文地名</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">我要去这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...在哪里？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">向驾驶员显示地址</td><td class="px-6 py-4">停在这里</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">这里停</td><td class="px-6 py-4">去这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">出租车</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">这里停</td><td class="px-6 py-4">旅行或等待时间</td><td class="px-6 py-4">专业提示：</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">始终用汉字显示您的目的地。</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">紧急情况</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Travel or wait time</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>专业提示：</strong> Always show your destination in Chinese characters.</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="emergencies" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span> Emergencies
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">救命！</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">仅适用于真正的紧急情况</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">显示中文地名</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">报警</td><td class="px-6 py-4">救命！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">紧急电话：120</td><td class="px-6 py-4">报警</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要救护车</td><td class="px-6 py-4">紧急电话：110</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">用中文显示目的地</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td><td class="px-6 py-4">发音技巧</td><td class="px-6 py-4">中文用法</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">音调</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我迷路了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">四种音调：</td><td class="px-6 py-4">音调</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="pronunciation" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎵</span> Pronunciation Tips
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">Chinese uses <strong>第一</strong> — the same syllable said in different pitches means different things. But don't stress too much. Context usually makes your meaning clear, and locals are forgiving of tourists.</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">妈妈</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">平坦、高音</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">第二</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Meaning</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">使麻木</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">上升音高</td><td class="px-6 py-4">第三</td><td class="px-6 py-4">m（马）</td><td class="px-6 py-4">先降后升</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">第四</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mà（马）</td><td class="px-6 py-4">责骂</td><td class="px-6 py-4">急剧下降</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">最佳提示：</td><td class="px-6 py-4">慢慢地说清楚。大多数中国人已经习惯了外国人在音调上的挣扎，并会努力理解。</td><td class="px-6 py-4">📚 相关指南</td><td class="px-6 py-4">🎒 您的中国之旅生存工具包</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">完整的旅行前检查表</td><td class="px-6 py-4">📱 中国需要的10个应用程序</td><td class="px-6 py-4">包括翻译工具在内的基本应用程序</td><td class="px-6 py-4">🏮 文化的注意事项</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>自信地应对社交场合</strong> Speak slowly and clearly. Most Chinese people are used to foreigners struggling with tones and will try to understand.</p>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 您的中国之旅生存工具包</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">📶 游客最佳SIM卡和eSIM</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 中国需要的10个应用程序</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">必备应用，包括翻译工具</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/tips/cultural-taboos/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🏮 Cultural Dos and Don'ts</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">自信地应对社交场合</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>语言参考——没有单一的官方来源。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>